=product @PRODUCER@ @BASE@ RSYNC @PCSIVERSION@ full
1 'PRODUCER
=prompt @PRODUCER@
1 'PRODUCT
=prompt rsync for OpenVMS (@KITVERSION@)
1 'NOTICE
=prompt openrsync is free software under the ISC licence. This is an early test kit.
1 RELEASE_NOTES
=prompt Documentation is in [RSYNC.DOC]README.VMS under the installation directory.
1 POST_INSTALL
=prompt Post-installation tasks for rsync
    At system startup: to define RSYNC$ROOT at every boot, add this line to
    SYS$MANAGER:SYSTARTUP_VMS.COM:
    $ @SYS$STARTUP:RSYNC$STARTUP.COM
    For each user: to define the rsync command, add this line to LOGIN.COM:
    $ @RSYNC$ROOT:[000000]RSYNC$SETUP.COM

PRODUCT REMOVE RSYNC removes the product and deassigns RSYNC$ROOT.
